  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal to remove condition 4 which requires upgrades to the existing drop kerb on both sides of the pavement, would lead to an unsatisfactory development of the site with poor access, failing to provide pedestrian safety and comfort at and within the vicinity of the site, which in turn would be detrimental to the safety of pedestrians. Thus, it is contrary to Policy EC2 of the Local Plan and Hounslow Residential Crossover and Off-Street Parking Policy."
